      "writtenOn": "2021-09-27T12:42:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is for having the APEX depend on the dexpreopt artifacts, so that the artifacts will be installed along with the APEX.\n\nThis shouldn\u0027t have any effect on unbundled builds because `DexpreoptBuiltInstalledForApex` is only set for APEX system server jars (https://cs.android.com/android/_/android/platform/build/soong/+/208d2962f062d8c9d852e0d8ffae3dd8a90ffe57:java/dexpreopt.go;l\u003d338-358;drc\u003d02669e8a301e62ec487eab5820b3c2f88a9d2cc6), and dexpreopting for APEX system server jars is disabled on unbundled builds (https://cs.android.com/android/_/android/platform/build/soong/+/208d2962f062d8c9d852e0d8ffae3dd8a90ffe57:java/dexpreopt.go;l\u003d153;drc\u003d02669e8a301e62ec487eab5820b3c2f88a9d2cc6).",
